%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Microsoft YaHei","primaryColor":"#EAF2F8","primaryTextColor":"#18324B","primaryBorderColor":"#2F5D7C","lineColor":"#607D8B"},"sequence":{"useMaxWidth":true,"wrap":true,"diagramMarginX":40,"diagramMarginY":24,"actorMargin":70,"width":220,"height":64,"boxMargin":12,"messageMargin":28}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Planner / Optimizer
    participant S as Round / Batch Scheduler
    participant C as HCCL / Local Copy
    participant M as Mapping / Selector
    P->>P: 当前布局与目标布局求差
    P->>S: 生成层级 ADD / REMOVE 指令
    S->>S: 按目标 rank 冲突图合并为 round
    S->>S: round 内按 source / target 去冲突拆成 batch
    loop 每个 round / batch
        S->>C: 准备 send / recv / local copy 描述
        C->>C: 批量传输权重与本地复制
        C-->>S: 全 rank 交换 round / batch 状态
    end
    S-->>P: 返回权重就绪状态
    alt 全部目标权重就绪
        P->>M: 原子更新 selector / mapping
        M-->>P: 校验负载与映射一致性
    else 传输或握手失败
        P->>M: 保留旧映射，记录异常并进入下一窗口
    end
